gest - getSHA1Base64\\(String source\\)#{1}":[110,125],"#GlideDigest- Scoped#GlideDigest - getSHA1Base64FromInputStream\\( GlideScriptableInputStream inputStream\\)":[126,143],"#GlideDigest- Scoped#GlideDigest - getSHA1Base64FromInputStream\\( GlideScriptableInputStream inputStream\\)#{1}":[128,143],"#GlideDigest- Scoped#GlideDigest - getSHA1Hex\\(String source\\)":[144,161],"#GlideDigest- Scoped#GlideDigest - getSHA1Hex\\(String source\\)#{1}":[146,161],"#GlideDigest- Scoped#GlideDigest - getSHA1HexFromInputStream\\( GlideScriptableInputStream inputStream\\)":[162,179],"#GlideDigest- Scoped#GlideDigest - getSHA1HexFromInputStream\\( GlideScriptableInputStream inputStream\\)#{1}":[164,179],"#GlideDigest- Scoped#GlideDigest - getSHA256Base64\\(String source\\)":[180,197],"#GlideDigest- Scoped#GlideDigest - getSHA256Base64\\(String source\\)#{1}":[182,197],"#GlideDigest- Scoped#GlideDigest - getSHA256Base64FromInputStream\\( GlideScriptableInputStream inputStream\\)":[198,215],"#GlideDigest- Scoped#GlideDigest - getSHA256Base64FromInputStream\\( GlideScriptableInputStream inputStream\\)#{1}":[200,215],"#GlideDigest- Scoped#GlideDigest - getSHA256Hex\\(String source\\)":[216,233],"#GlideDigest- Scoped#GlideDigest - getSHA256Hex\\(String source\\)#{1}":[218,233],"#GlideDigest- Scoped#GlideDigest - getSHA256HexFromInputStream\\( GlideScriptableInputStream inputStream\\)":[234,252],"#GlideDigest- Scoped#GlideDigest - getSHA256HexFromInputStream\\( GlideScriptableInputStream inputStream\\)#{1}":[236,252]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Server API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/api-server.md","line":26}],"metadata":{"title":"GlideDigest - Scoped","description":"The scoped GlideDigest class provides methods for creating a message digest from strings or input streams using MD5, SHA1, or SHA256 hash algorithms.Creates an instance of scoped GlideDigest.Creates a message digest from a string using the MD5 algorithm. The output string is in Base64.Creates a message digest from an input stream using the MD5 algorithm. The output string is in Base64.Creates a message digest from a string using the MD5 algorithm. The output string is in hexadecimal.Creates a message digest from an input stream using the MD5 algorithm. The output string is in hexadecimal.Creates a message digest from a string using the SHA1 algorithm. The output string is in Base64.Creates a message digest from an input stream using the SHA1 algorithm. The output string is in Base64.Creates a message digest from a string using the SHA1 algorithm. The output string is in hexadecimal.Creates a message digest from an input stream using the SHA1 algorithm. The output string is in hexadecimal.Creates a message digest from a string using the SHA256 algorithm. The output string is in Base64.Creates a message digest from an input stream using the SHA256 algorithm. The output string is in Base64.Creates a message digest from a string using the SHA256 algorithm. The output string is in hexadecimal.Creates a message digest from an input stream using the SHA256 algorithm. The output string is in hexadecimal.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/c\\_GlideDigestScopedAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":3,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[48,52],[66,70],[84,88],[102,106],[120,124],[138,142],[156,160],[174,178],[192,196],[210,214],[228,232],[246,250]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideDigestScopedAPI.md"},
